---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const title = "How to Record Your Screen Without Software (Free Guide)";
const description = "Learn how to easily record your computer screen on Windows, Mac, or Chromebook without downloading any software or extensions. 100% free and private.";

const jsonLd = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "HowTo",
  "name": "How to Record Your Screen Without Software",
  "description": "A step-by-step guide to recording your computer screen directly from your web browser without installing any third-party software.",
  "step": [
    {
      "@type": "HowToStep",
      "name": "Open a Web-Based Screen Recorder",
      "text": "Navigate to a free, secure web recorder like ScreenRecord in your modern web browser (Chrome, Edge, Safari, or Firefox)."
    },
    {
      "@type": "HowToStep",
      "name": "Select Your Recording Mode",
      "text": "Choose what you want to capture: your entire screen, a specific application window, or just a single browser tab. You can also opt to include microphone audio."
    },
    {
      "@type": "HowToStep",
      "name": "Start Capturing",
      "text": "Click the 'Start Recording' button and grant your browser permission to view the screen you selected."
    },
    {
      "@type": "HowToStep",
      "name": "Download Your Video",
      "text": "Once you finish your task, click stop. The video file will instantly be ready for download directly to your hard drive."
    }
  ]
};
---

<Layout title={title} description={description}>
  <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(jsonLd)} is:inline />
  
  <main class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-12 sm:py-20">
    <article class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 p-8 sm:p-12 rounded-3xl shadow-sm border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700">
      
      <header class="mb-10 border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 pb-8">
        <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 dark:text-white tracking-tight mb-4">
          How to Record Your Screen Without Downloading Software
        </h1>
        <p class="text-lg text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">
          Whether you need to capture a quick tutorial, record a presentation, or save a webinar, you no longer need to download heavy, expensive screen recording applications. Modern web browsers can do it all for free.
        </p>
      </header>

      <div class="space-y-8 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
        
        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-4">The Secret: The MediaRecorder API</h2>
          <p class="mb-4">
            In the past, recording your screen on a PC or Mac required downloading software like OBS Studio, Camtasia, or installing suspicious browser extensions. 
          </p>
          <p>
            Today, modern browsers (like Google Chrome, Microsoft Edge, and Safari) include a native technology called the <strong>MediaRecorder API</strong>. This allows web applications to capture your screen, webcam, and microphone directly through the browser with zero installations.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-4">Step-by-Step Guide</h2>
          
          <div class="space-y-6 mt-6">
            <div class="flex gap-4">
              <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-rose-100 dark:bg-rose-900/30 text-rose-600 dark:text-rose-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg">1</div>
              <div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-2">Open a Web-Based Recorder</h3>
                <p>Navigate to our homepage at <a href="/" class="text-rose-600 dark:text-rose-400 hover:underline font-medium">ScreenRecord</a>. Because it relies entirely on your browser, it works instantly on Windows, macOS, Linux, and ChromeOS without any setup files.</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="flex gap-4">
              <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-rose-100 dark:bg-rose-900/30 text-rose-600 dark:text-rose-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg">2</div>
              <div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-2">Choose What to Share</h3>
                <p>When you click "Start Recording", your browser will ask you what you want to share. You can choose to record your <strong>Entire Screen</strong>, a specific <strong>Application Window</strong>, or just a single <strong>Chrome Tab</strong>. This ensures you only share what you intend to.</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="flex gap-4">
              <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-rose-100 dark:bg-rose-900/30 text-rose-600 dark:text-rose-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg">3</div>
              <div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-2">Stop and Save</h3>
                <p>Once you are done capturing your video, simply click the stop button. Because the video was processed locally in your computer's RAM, the final `.webm` or `.mp4` file will be generated instantly for you to download. No waiting for cloud servers to process your video!</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-900/50 p-6 rounded-2xl mt-10">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-3">Is it safe and private?</h2>
          <p>
            Yes! Using a client-side web recorder is actually <strong>more secure</strong> than downloading software. When you use an app like ScreenRecord, the video data never leaves your computer. It is never uploaded to a cloud server, meaning there is zero risk of data breaches or privacy violations.
          </p>
        </section>

        <div class="mt-12 text-center pt-8 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700">
          <a href="/" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center bg-rose-500 hover:bg-rose-600 text-white font-medium py-3 px-8 rounded-full text-lg shadow-sm transition-all hover:shadow-md">
            Try the Free Screen Recorder Now
          </a>
        </div>

      </div>
    </article>
  </main>
</Layout>
